summary: Enabling memstrack for debugging kdump memory usage
description: |
    It enables memstrack for debugging memory usage during kdump
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
    - kexec-tools
    - memstrack
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/config-memstrack
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/config-memstrack
